{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"unplayful-bizarre-sable","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests/unit cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_normalization.py:1-16` — Preserve effective-vocabulary precedence, synonym mapping, pass-through, and pre-routing placement. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_routing.py:1-14` — Preserve explicit routing, budget-backed posture, overlay protection, and replay-set parity. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py:1-19` — Preserve snapshot-driven stage plan, execution facts, budget shedding, and failure resilience. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_finalize.py:1-14` — Preserve Pass-1 usage aggregation and folded-total assertion. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_fp_ledger.py:1-11, 307-311` — Preserve ledger idempotence, malformed/error behavior, non-gating telemetry, and missing-verification signal. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_gate_session.py:1-15, 149-161` — Preserve attested code/ticket snapshots and rerooted runner config. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_per_pass_classes.py:1-36, 95-101, 173-182` — Preserve exact class placement, batch-subdict trap, provider consistency, and obsolete-helper consumer guard. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance_heldout_2d1c.py:1-17` — Preserve adversarial wrong-provenance/signability cases. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance.py:1-14` — Preserve ref/source propagation and truthful signability provenance. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_triggers.py:1-19, 137-140, 222-229` — Preserve additive project triggers, repository root threading, and dogfood config-effect contrast. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_verifier_class.py:1-20, 173-182` — Preserve standard-class resolution, cross-provider behavior, determinism, and obsolete-helper census. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_ws2.py:65-74` — Preserve current approved blocking set, thresholds, and calibration-document pointer. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_code_review_ws4.py:22-33, 79-84, 267-275` — Preserve local-source fixture reason, explicit-operation availability, and verification persistence. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py:1-18, 428-437` — Preserve inherited-root hazard, AST requirement, real collection/marker resolution, and sanctioned nested launcher. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_commit_tickets_branch_pathspec_11a9.py:1-10` — Preserve pathspec-only staging, write lock, and no-push contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_all_selection.py:1-22, 244-252` — Preserve recurring selection, foldable-event/horizon convergence, honest count, and push decoupling. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_crash_atomicity.py:1-21` — Preserve pre/post-fold atomicity, external intent journal, recovery scope, and inconsistent-snapshot ownership. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_compact_sweep_perf.py:1-25, 93-108, 253-261, 291-300, 383-390` — Preserve one pre-lock history walk, signed/committed fixture requirements, compatibility fallback, path-scoped staging, and `None` failure sentinel. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_normalization.py tests/unit/test_code_review_criteria_routing.py tests/unit/test_code_review_discovery.py tests/unit/test_code_review_finalize.py tests/unit/test_code_review_fp_ledger.py tests/unit/test_code_review_gate_session.py tests/unit/test_code_review_per_pass_classes.py tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance_heldout_2d1c.py tests/unit/test_code_review_provenance.py tests/unit/test_code_review_triggers.py tests/unit/test_code_review_verifier_class.py tests/unit/test_code_review_ws2.py tests/unit/test_code_review_ws4.py tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py tests/unit/test_commit_tickets_branch_pathspec_11a9.py tests/unit/test_compact_all_selection.py tests/unit/test_compact_crash_atomicity.py tests/unit/test_compact_sweep_perf.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"e166-8a3d-3aeb-4580","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","